&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking a curious, analytical intern who brings a fresh perspective and is eager to help the Financial Planning &amp;amp; Analysis team identify ways to improve. As a Financial Planning &amp;amp; Analysis Intern at MongoDB, you’ll build relationships across the business and serve as a trusted partner to the Product &amp;amp; Technology Finance team. You’ll develop a strong understanding of business drivers and how financial plans support MongoDB’s broader objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll collaborate with stakeholders on budgeting, headcount planning, and resource optimization, while building and maintaining financial and operating models. You’ll also help improve how we input and manage forecasts in our financial systems, and conduct ad hoc analyses to inform operating strategies, resource allocation, and investment decisions for product initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
