&lt;li&gt;Foundational experience using data and spreadsheets to support decision-making, with curiosity about a career in financial planning and analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses sound judgment when working with incomplete data, making and clearly explaining reasonable assumptions while knowing when to pause and seek guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance accuracy with efficiency, knowing when to prioritize each.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Microsoft Excel, Word, and PowerPoint and Google Sheets, Docs, and Slides&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication and ability to collaborate effectively via Slack and other tools&lt;/li&gt;
